      "question": {
        ":question/id": "cc012d6e-17d6-5b41-813e-869311eeed2b",
        ":question/problem": "A dairy farm sells milk on a particular day for $p(v)$ dollars, where $v$ is the number of liters of milk in the dairy farm at the start of the day. What are the units of $\\frac{\\text{d}p}{\\text{d}v}?$",
